            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Within each department/agency there shall be established a Unit 9 Training and Career Ladders Subcommittee with the responsibility of reviewing existing training programs and career ladders in that department/agency and developing new training programs and career ladder recommendations for submission to the Unit 9 Training and Career Ladders Committee.",
