        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "A. Effective January 1, 2000, the Employer shall establish a fund in the amount of $35.00 per full time equivalent, and on January 1, 2001, sh all add an equivalent amount to said fund, per full-time employee equivalent, on the payroll to maintain the Statewide Training and Career Ladders program.",
